 "body": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../assets/css/oee.css?v=4.45\"><p>The order was quoted, won, built and delivered. The money arrives two months later. Quote to cash is the name for that whole path, and most of it runs through the office, not the factory.</p>\n<p>This series follows one example: Example Windows Co., a made-up 40-person window maker with sales of about $12 million a year. This post maps the process and shows where the days and the cash sit. <a href=\"quote-to-cash-simulation-run-a-window-factory-in-3d.html\">Part&nbsp;2</a> lets you run the factory in a live 3D simulation. <a href=\"shorten-quote-to-cash-what-to-fix-first.html\">Part&nbsp;3</a> covers what to fix first and the payback.</p>\n<h2>What quote to cash means</h2>\n<p>Quote to cash (Q2C) covers every step from a customer's request for a price to the payment reaching the bank. Order to cash (O2C) is the same path without the quoting step. A made-to-order manufacturer should include the quote, because every job starts with one and nothing else can start until the customer accepts it.</p>\n<p>Two numbers describe the process:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Quote-to-cash days.</strong> The time from the customer's request to the payment.</li>\n<li><strong>Cash tied up.</strong> The money already paid out for materials and labour on orders that customers have not yet paid for.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>The eight stages</h2>\n<p>Six groups handle an order: the customer, sales, planning and purchasing, production, shipping and finance. Figure 1 shows who does each step and when it is finished in the example.</p>\n<figure>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Swim lane diagram of the quote-to-cash process with six lanes: customer, sales, planning and purchasing, production, shipping and finance. Twelve steps run from the customer asking for a quote on day 0 to the payment being recorded on day 66.\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 880\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block;min-width:640px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Inter,system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\"><rect x=\"64\" y=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"846\" fill=\"#F7F9FB\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><rect x=\"64\" y=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"44\" fill=\"#E6F0F7\" stroke=\"#9AB0C8\"/><text x=\"122.0\" y=\"26.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">Customer</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"846\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"44\" fill=\"#E6F0F7\" stroke=\"#9AB0C8\"/><text x=\"238.0\" y=\"26.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">Sales</text><rect x=\"296\" y=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"846\" fill=\"#F7F9FB\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><rect x=\"296\" y=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"44\" fill=\"#E6F0F7\" stroke=\"#9AB0C8\"/><text x=\"354.0\" y=\"19.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">Planning and</text><text x=\"354.0\" y=\"34.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">purchasing</text><rect x=\"412\" y=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"846\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><rect x=\"412\" y=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"44\" fill=\"#E6F0F7\" stroke=\"#9AB0C8\"/><text x=\"470.0\" y=\"26.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">Production</text><rect x=\"528\" y=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"846\" fill=\"#F7F9FB\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><rect x=\"528\" y=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"44\" fill=\"#E6F0F7\" stroke=\"#9AB0C8\"/><text x=\"586.0\" y=\"26.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">Shipping</text><rect x=\"644\" y=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"846\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><rect x=\"644\" y=\"0\" width=\"116\" height=\"44\" fill=\"#E6F0F7\" stroke=\"#9AB0C8\"/><text x=\"702.0\" y=\"26.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">Finance</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"26.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\" font-weight=\"600\">Done by</text><line x1=\"58\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"846\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><rect x=\"69.0\" y=\"58\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#EEF0F3\" stroke=\"#8794A1\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"122.0\" y=\"80.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\">Asks for a quote</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"80.3\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Day 0</text><line x1=\"58\" y1=\"76.0\" x2=\"63\" y2=\"76.0\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><rect x=\"185.0\" y=\"124\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#EEF0F3\" stroke=\"#8794A1\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"238.0\" y=\"146.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">1. Prepare quote</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"146.3\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Day 5</text><line x1=\"58\" y1=\"142.0\" x2=\"63\" y2=\"142.0\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><rect x=\"69.0\" y=\"190\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#EEF0F3\" stroke=\"#8794A1\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"122.0\" y=\"212.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\">Accepts quote</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"212.3\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Day 8</text><line x1=\"58\" y1=\"208.0\" x2=\"63\" y2=\"208.0\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><rect x=\"185.0\" y=\"256\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#EEF0F3\" stroke=\"#8794A1\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"238.0\" y=\"278.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">2. Enter order</text><rect x=\"301.0\" y=\"322\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#EEF0F3\" stroke=\"#8794A1\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"354.0\" y=\"344.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">3. Schedule job</text><rect x=\"301.0\" y=\"388\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#FBEBD3\" stroke=\"#C27712\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"354.0\" y=\"410.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">4. Buy materials</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"410.3\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Day 15</text><line x1=\"58\" y1=\"406.0\" x2=\"63\" y2=\"406.0\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><rect x=\"417.0\" y=\"454\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#FBEBD3\" stroke=\"#C27712\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"470.0\" y=\"476.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">5. Build</text><rect x=\"417.0\" y=\"520\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#FBEBD3\" stroke=\"#C27712\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"470.0\" y=\"542.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">6. Inspect, pack</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"542.3\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Day 20</text><line x1=\"58\" y1=\"538.0\" x2=\"63\" y2=\"538.0\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><rect x=\"533.0\" y=\"586\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#FBEBD3\" stroke=\"#C27712\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"586.0\" y=\"608.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">7. Deliver</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"608.3\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Day 22</text><line x1=\"58\" y1=\"604.0\" x2=\"63\" y2=\"604.0\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><rect x=\"649.0\" y=\"652\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#E9E8FA\" stroke=\"#5B5BD0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"702.0\" y=\"674.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">8. Send invoice</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"674.3\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Day 27</text><line x1=\"58\" y1=\"670.0\" x2=\"63\" y2=\"670.0\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><rect x=\"69.0\" y=\"718\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#E9E8FA\" stroke=\"#5B5BD0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"122.0\" y=\"740.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\">Pays invoice</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"740.3\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Day 66</text><line x1=\"58\" y1=\"736.0\" x2=\"63\" y2=\"736.0\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><rect x=\"649.0\" y=\"784\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#E4F1D3\" stroke=\"#4D7F12\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"702.0\" y=\"806.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\">Record cash</text><path d=\"M122.0,94 V97 Q122.0,103 128.0,103 H232.0 Q238.0,103 238.0,109\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M238.0,109 V115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"233.0,115 243.0,115 238.0,124\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\"/><path d=\"M238.0,160 V163 Q238.0,169 232.0,169 H128.0 Q122.0,169 122.0,175\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><path d=\"M122.0,175 V181\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"117.0,181 127.0,181 122.0,190\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\"/><path d=\"M122.0,226 V229 Q122.0,235 128.0,235 H232.0 Q238.0,235 238.0,241\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M238.0,241 V247\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"233.0,247 243.0,247 238.0,256\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\"/><path d=\"M238.0,292 V295 Q238.0,301 244.0,301 H348.0 Q354.0,301 354.0,307\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M354.0,307 V313\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"349.0,313 359.0,313 354.0,322\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\"/><path d=\"M354.0,358 V379\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"349.0,379 359.0,379 354.0,388\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\"/><path d=\"M354.0,424 V427 Q354.0,433 360.0,433 H464.0 Q470.0,433 470.0,439\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M470.0,439 V445\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"465.0,445 475.0,445 470.0,454\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\"/><path d=\"M470.0,490 V511\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"465.0,511 475.0,511 470.0,520\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\"/><path d=\"M470.0,556 V559 Q470.0,565 476.0,565 H580.0 Q586.0,565 586.0,571\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M586.0,571 V577\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"581.0,577 591.0,577 586.0,586\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\"/><path d=\"M586.0,622 V625 Q586.0,631 592.0,631 H696.0 Q702.0,631 702.0,637\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M702.0,637 V643\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"697.0,643 707.0,643 702.0,652\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\"/><path d=\"M702.0,688 V691 Q702.0,697 696.0,697 H128.0 Q122.0,697 122.0,703\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><path d=\"M122.0,703 V709\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"117.0,709 127.0,709 122.0,718\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\"/><path d=\"M122.0,754 V757 Q122.0,763 128.0,763 H696.0 Q702.0,763 702.0,769\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M702.0,769 V775\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"697.0,775 707.0,775 702.0,784\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\"/><rect x=\"64\" y=\"857\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#EEF0F3\" stroke=\"#8794A1\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"84\" y=\"868\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Nothing spent yet</text><rect x=\"201.4\" y=\"857\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FBEBD3\" stroke=\"#C27712\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"221.4\" y=\"868\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Cash spent, not billed</text><rect x=\"369.8\" y=\"857\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E9E8FA\" stroke=\"#5B5BD0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"389.8\" y=\"868\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Billed, not paid</text><rect x=\"501.0\" y=\"857\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E4F1D3\" stroke=\"#4D7F12\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"521.0\" y=\"868\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Paid</text><path d=\"M557.8,864 H571.8\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><path d=\"M573.8,864 H579.8\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"579.8,859 579.8,869 588.8,864\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\"/><text x=\"595.8\" y=\"868\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Waiting on the customer</text></svg></div>\n<figcaption>Figure 1. The quote-to-cash process at Example Windows Co. The numbered boxes are the eight stages. The colour shows where the money is at each step.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p>Every stage hands something to the next one. Days are lost at the handovers, where work waits in a queue or goes back for missing information.</p>\n<p class=\"oee-cap\">Table 1. The eight stages, who owns them and where days are lost</p>\n<table>\n<tr><th>Stage</th><th>Owner</th><th>What it hands over</th><th>Where the days are lost</th></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">1. Quote</td><td>Sales</td><td>A price, a specification and a delivery date</td><td>Requests queue behind one estimator. Prices are worked out by hand.</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">2. Order</td><td>Sales</td><td>A confirmed order that matches the quote</td><td>Details are typed again from the quote. Sizes or colours are missing.</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">3. Schedule</td><td>Planning</td><td>A production slot and a promised date</td><td>The date is promised before capacity is checked.</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">4. Procure</td><td>Purchasing</td><td>Glass, profiles and hardware for the job</td><td>Materials are ordered late. Supplier lead times vary.</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">5. Produce</td><td>Production</td><td>Finished windows</td><td>Orders wait for a full batch. Changeovers and machine stoppages.</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">6. Inspect</td><td>Production</td><td>Packed windows that meet the specification</td><td>Defects are found at the end of the line and reworked.</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">7. Ship</td><td>Shipping</td><td>Delivery to the site, with proof of delivery</td><td>Part loads wait for a full truck. The signed slip goes missing.</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">8. Invoice and collect</td><td>Finance</td><td>An invoice, then the payment</td><td>Invoices are raised in a weekly batch. Nobody follows up overdue accounts.</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h2>Where the days go</h2>\n<p>In the example, an average order takes 66 days from request to payment. The figures come from the simulation model in <a href=\"quote-to-cash-simulation-run-a-window-factory-in-3d.html\">Part&nbsp;2</a>, run for one year at its starting settings.</p>\n<p class=\"oee-cap\">Table 2. Average days in each stage of the example</p>\n<table>\n<tr><th>Stage</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Who controls it</th><th>Where the money is</th></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">Writing the quote</td><td class=\"num\">5.0</td><td>Sales</td><td>Nothing spent yet</td></tr><tr><td class=\"nw\">Customer decides</td><td class=\"num\">2.9</td><td>Customer</td><td>Nothing spent yet</td></tr><tr><td class=\"nw\">Order entry and materials</td><td class=\"num\">7.1</td><td>Sales, purchasing, suppliers</td><td>Cash spent, not billed</td></tr><tr><td class=\"nw\">Production</td><td class=\"num\">4.7</td><td>Factory</td><td>Cash spent, not billed</td></tr><tr><td class=\"nw\">Delivery</td><td class=\"num\">2.0</td><td>Shipping</td><td>Cash spent, not billed</td></tr><tr><td class=\"nw\">Waiting to invoice</td><td class=\"num\">5.0</td><td>Finance</td><td>Cash spent, not billed</td></tr><tr><td class=\"nw\">Waiting to be paid</td><td class=\"num\">39.6</td><td>Customer, finance</td><td>Billed, not paid</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"oee-total\"><td>Total</td><td class=\"num\">66.3</td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n<figure>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cascade chart of the 66.3 days of an average order. Writing the quote and the customer's decision take 8 days with nothing spent. Order entry, materials, production, delivery and the wait to invoice take 19 days with cash spent. Waiting to be paid takes 40 days.\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 282\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block;min-width:600px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Inter,system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\"><line x1=\"186.0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"186.0\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><text x=\"186.0\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">0</text><line x1=\"263.8\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"263.8\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><text x=\"263.82805429864254\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">10</text><line x1=\"341.7\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"341.7\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><text x=\"341.6561085972851\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">20</text><line x1=\"419.5\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"419.5\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><text x=\"419.4841628959276\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">30</text><line x1=\"497.3\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"497.3\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><text x=\"497.31221719457017\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">40</text><line x1=\"575.1\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"575.1\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><text x=\"575.1402714932127\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">50</text><line x1=\"653.0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"653.0\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\"/><text x=\"652.9683257918552\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">60</text><text x=\"444.0\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Days since the customer asked for a quote</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"27\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\">Writing the quote</text><rect x=\"186.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"38.9\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#EEF0F3\" stroke=\"#8794A1\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"231.91402714932127\" y=\"27\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">5.0</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\">Customer decides</text><rect x=\"224.9\" y=\"40\" width=\"22.6\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#EEF0F3\" stroke=\"#8794A1\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"254.4841628959276\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">2.9</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"83\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\">Order entry and materials</text><rect x=\"247.5\" y=\"68\" width=\"55.3\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FBEBD3\" stroke=\"#C27712\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"309.7420814479638\" y=\"83\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">7.1</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\">Production</text><rect x=\"302.7\" y=\"96\" width=\"36.6\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FBEBD3\" stroke=\"#C27712\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"346.32126696832574\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">4.7</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"139\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\">Delivery</text><rect x=\"339.3\" y=\"124\" width=\"15.6\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FBEBD3\" stroke=\"#C27712\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"361.88687782805425\" y=\"139\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">2.0</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"167\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\">Waiting to invoice</text><rect x=\"354.9\" y=\"152\" width=\"38.9\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FBEBD3\" stroke=\"#C27712\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"400.8009049773756\" y=\"167\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">5.0</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\">Waiting to be paid</text><rect x=\"393.8\" y=\"180\" width=\"308.2\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E9E8FA\" stroke=\"#5B5BD0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"709.0\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">39.6</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"265\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#EEF0F3\" stroke=\"#8794A1\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Nothing spent yet: 8 days</text><rect x=\"201.5\" y=\"265\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FBEBD3\" stroke=\"#C27712\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"221.5\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Cash spent, not billed: 19 days</text><rect x=\"436.79999999999995\" y=\"265\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E9E8FA\" stroke=\"#5B5BD0\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"456.79999999999995\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Billed, not paid: 40 days</text></svg></div>\n<figcaption>Figure 2. The 66 days of an average order, stage by stage. Production is the fourth bar.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p>Three points stand out.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Production is about 7% of the time.</strong> The windows spend under 5 days in the factory, and that includes waiting for a batch. A faster line would barely change the total. For what happens inside those days, see <a href=\"what-oee-really-measures.html\">What OEE Really Measures</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Office waits take four times as long as production.</strong> Writing the quote takes 5 days, sending the invoice takes another 5, and customers pay about 10 days late. Those 20 days need no new equipment to fix.</li>\n<li><strong>Waiting to be paid is 60% of the total.</strong> The terms are 30 days, and the average customer takes about 40. The clock starts when the invoice goes out, so every day of invoicing delay is added on top.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Where the cash sits</h2>\n<p>An average order is 20 windows for $20,000. The company pays $8,000 for materials when the order is confirmed and adds $4,000 of labour on the line. The remaining $8,000 covers overhead and profit. Figure 3 follows the cash for one order.</p>\n<figure>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Line chart of the cash position of one $20,000 order. It is zero until day 8, falls to minus $8,000 when materials are bought, falls to minus $12,000 by day 20 as labour is added, stays there until the customer pays on day 66, then rises to plus $8,000.\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 320\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block;min-width:600px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Inter,system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\"><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"36.8\" x2=\"740\" y2=\"36.8\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"68\" y=\"40.763636363636365\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">+$8,000</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"111.8\" x2=\"740\" y2=\"111.8\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"68\" y=\"115.81818181818181\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">$0</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"186.9\" x2=\"740\" y2=\"186.9\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"68\" y=\"190.87272727272727\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">−$8,000</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"224.4\" x2=\"740\" y2=\"224.4\" stroke=\"#D9D5CA\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"68\" y=\"228.4\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">−$12,000</text><line x1=\"76.0\" y1=\"276\" x2=\"76.0\" y2=\"281\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><text x=\"76.0\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">0</text><line x1=\"170.9\" y1=\"276\" x2=\"170.9\" y2=\"281\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><text x=\"170.85714285714286\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">10</text><line x1=\"265.7\" y1=\"276\" x2=\"265.7\" y2=\"281\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><text x=\"265.7142857142857\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">20</text><line x1=\"360.6\" y1=\"276\" x2=\"360.6\" y2=\"281\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><text x=\"360.57142857142856\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">30</text><line x1=\"455.4\" y1=\"276\" x2=\"455.4\" y2=\"281\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><text x=\"455.42857142857144\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">40</text><line x1=\"550.3\" y1=\"276\" x2=\"550.3\" y2=\"281\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><text x=\"550.2857142857142\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">50</text><line x1=\"645.1\" y1=\"276\" x2=\"645.1\" y2=\"281\" stroke=\"#5A6475\"/><text x=\"645.1428571428571\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">60</text><text x=\"408.0\" y=\"314\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Days since the customer asked for a quote</text><path d=\"M151.9,111.8 L151.9,186.9 L218.3,186.9 L265.7,224.4 L702.1,224.4 L702.1,111.8 z\" fill=\"#FBEBD3\"/><path d=\"M702.1,111.8 L702.1,36.8 L740.0,36.8 L740.0,111.8 z\" fill=\"#E4F1D3\"/><path d=\"M76.0,111.8 L151.9,111.8 L151.9,186.9 L218.3,186.9 L265.7,224.4 L702.1,224.4 L702.1,36.8 L740.0,36.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"159.8857142857143\" y=\"153.34545454545454\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#C27712\" font-weight=\"600\">Materials bought: −$8,000</text><text x=\"273.7142857142857\" y=\"208.45090909090908\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#C27712\" font-weight=\"600\">Labour added: −$4,000</text><text x=\"483.8857142857143\" y=\"172.1090909090909\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0B2A5A\" font-weight=\"600\">58 days out of pocket</text><text x=\"694.0571428571428\" y=\"78.29090909090908\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#4D7F12\" font-weight=\"600\">Customer pays: +$20,000</text><line x1=\"284.7\" y1=\"219.4\" x2=\"284.7\" y2=\"229.4\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"332.1\" y1=\"219.4\" x2=\"332.1\" y2=\"229.4\" stroke=\"#0B2A5A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"281.6857142857143\" y=\"243.4\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Delivered</text><text x=\"335.1142857142857\" y=\"243.4\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5A6475\">Invoiced</text></svg></div>\n<figcaption>Figure 3. Cash position of one order. The company pays out on day 8 and is paid on day 66.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p>The company is out of pocket on each order for 58 days. It takes about 1.6 orders a day, so about 96 orders are open with money spent on them at any time. Together they tie up about $1.06 million. The owner funds that amount from a credit line or from retained profit.</p>\n<p>The same arithmetic gives a useful rule for this example. After an order is built it carries $12,000 of cost, and 1.6 orders a day reach that point. Each day removed between delivery and payment therefore frees about $19,000 of cash. Invoicing on the day of delivery, 5 days sooner, frees close to $100,000.</p>\n<h2>Five measures to track</h2>\n<p>Most accounting and ERP systems already hold the dates needed for these measures. If yours does not, a spreadsheet with one row per order and six dates is enough to start.</p>\n<p class=\"oee-cap\">Table 3. Quote-to-cash measures and their values in the example</p>\n<table>\n<tr><th class=\"nw\">Measure</th><th>How to calculate it</th><th class=\"num\">Example</th></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">Quote turnaround</td><td>Days from the request to the quote being sent</td><td class=\"num\">5 days</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">Order lead time</td><td>Days from the confirmed order to delivery</td><td class=\"num\">14 days</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">On-time delivery</td><td>Orders delivered by the promised date ÷ orders delivered</td><td class=\"num\">80%</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">Invoice lag</td><td>Days from delivery to the invoice being sent</td><td class=\"num\">5 days</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"nw\">Days sales outstanding (DSO)</td><td>Unpaid invoices ÷ sales per day. Here $1.28 million ÷ $32,000.</td><td class=\"num\">40 days</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>The promised date in the example is 15 days after the order. One order in five misses it, mostly because materials arrive late or the order waits for a batch. <a href=\"production-planning-and-scheduling-for-manufacturing.html\">Production Planning and Scheduling for Manufacturing</a> covers how to set dates the plant can keep.</p>\n<h2>Three common mistakes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Measuring only the factory.</strong> Output and scrap are tracked daily, while nobody knows how long a quote or an invoice takes.</li>\n<li><strong>Treating the invoice as paperwork.</strong> The invoice starts the customer's payment clock. A weekly invoicing run adds several days to every order.</li>\n<li><strong>Looking at each department alone.</strong> Each group meets its own target, and the order still waits at every handover. One person should own the total number of days.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"oee-takeaway\"><p><strong>Takeaway.</strong> Map the eight stages, put a date on each handover and add up the days. In the example an order takes 66 days to become cash, the factory accounts for about 5 of them, and about $1.06 million is tied up in open orders.</p></div>\n<div class=\"oee-next\"><a class=\"oee-fwd\" href=\"quote-to-cash-simulation-run-a-window-factory-in-3d.html\">Next: Part&nbsp;2, run the factory in 3D →</a></div>\n<p class=\"oee-note\"><em>Example Windows Co. and its figures are an illustrative example. The days and dollars come from a simulation model with round-number inputs, and they do not describe any real company.</em></p>",
